      "snippet": {
        "line": 152,
        "text": "moment B (m + 1) (dr f) eta = B ^ (m + 1) * f (B, eta) - ((m + 1 : ℕ) : ℝ) * moment B m f eta; at m = 1 with f (B, eta) = 0 this is ∫_0^B R f dR = -(1/2)∫_0^B R² ∂_R f dR"
